      "title": "HDFCAMC: Dividend Plans And Board Actions Will Shape Measured Future Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have raised their fair value estimate for HDFC Asset Management slightly to ₹3,029.35 from ₹3,027.50, reflecting updated views on revenue growth expectations, profit margins and a modestly lower assumed future P/E multiple. What's in the News The board has recommended a final dividend of ₹54 per equity share of face value ₹5 for the year ended March 31, 2026, subject to shareholder approval at the upcoming Annual General Meeting (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/diversified-financials/nse-hdfcamc/hdfc-asset-management-shares/b79vjrvu-upcoming-shareholder-decisions-and-revenue-forecasts-will-drive-new-opportunities/updates/24-analysts-have-raised-their-fair-value-estimate-for-hdfc-asse",
